      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">Program Overview</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Investing in Teton Valley Nonprofits</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">Our Competitive Grants program provides annual funding to local nonprofits addressing critical community needs. Awards are determined through a thorough application and review process, ensuring funds are directed where they can make the greatest impact.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">Each year, the Community Foundation distributes grants from its community funds to organizations that demonstrate strong alignment with community priorities, sound organizational management, and clear plans for measurable outcomes.</p>
